Pallars Sobirà Nord. Escala 1:50.000. Editorial Piolet.', '{"en":"This moderate 15.9 km loop to Montcaubo (Lo Calbo) and Cap de Rocagran starts in Estaon, a mountain village accessible via the L-504 from Llavorsí. The route begins on the Camí de Perafita and ascends past Borda de Palau to Coll de Lo Caubo, then to the summit of Lo Caubo (2291m).\n\nThe trail continues to Plans de Cerdanyís, Collada de Burgo, and Cap de la Rocagran (2163m), offering extensive views of the Alt Pirineu. The descent passes Coll de Campirme, Torrent de la Selva, and Bordes de Nibrós before returning to the starting point. This route is ideal in late spring to enjoy the local butterfly population.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 15,9 km a Montcaubo (Lo Calbo) i Cap de Rocagran comença a Estaon, un poble de muntanya accessible per la L-504 des de Llavorsí. El recorregut s''inicia pel Camí de Perafita i puja passant per la Borda de Palau fins al Coll de Lo Caubo, per després assolir el cim de Lo Caubo (2291m).\n\nEl camí continua cap als Plans de Cerdanyís, la Collada de Burgo i el Cap de la Rocagran (2163m), oferint àmplies vistes de l''Alt Pirineu. El descens passa pel Coll de Campirme, el Torrent de la Selva i les Bordes de Nibrós abans de tornar al punt d''inici. Aquesta ruta és ideal a finals de primavera per gaudir de la població local de papallones.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 15,9 km a Montcaubo (Lo Calbo) y Cap de Rocagran comienza en Estaon, un pueblo de montaña accesible por la L-504 desde Llavorsí. El recorrido se inicia por el Camí de Perafita y asciende pasando por la Borda de Palau hasta el Coll de Lo Caubo, para luego alcanzar la cima de Lo Caubo (2291m).\n\nEl sendero continúa hacia los Plans de Cerdanyís, la Collada de Burgo y el Cap de la Rocagran (2163m), ofreciendo amplias vistas del Alt Pirineu. El descenso pasa por el Coll de Campirme, el Torrent de la Selva y las Bordes de Nibrós antes de regresar al punto de inicio. Esta ruta es ideal a finales de primavera para disfrutar de la población local de mariposas."}'::jsonb, 'i-tram', 15900, 1123, 1123, 2291, 1165, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 29460, 2128, '2018-06-24', '2018-05', '[{"lat":42.589882,"lng":1.213798,"ele":1166.6},{"lat":42.58988,"lng":1.213805,"ele":1166.5},{"lat":42.589887,"lng":1.213837,"ele":1166.2},{"lat":42.589898,"lng":1.21387,"ele":1165.9},{"lat":42.589898,"lng":1.21388,"ele":1165.7},{"lat":42.589938,"lng":1.213803,"ele":1165.2},{"lat":42.589933,"lng":1.213875,"ele":1165.7},{"lat":42.589937,"lng":1.213863,"ele":1165.7},{"lat":42.589952,"lng":1.21386,"ele":1165.7},{"lat":42.59002,"lng":1.213913,"ele":1166.3},{"lat":42.590083,"lng":1.213928,"ele":1166.8},{"lat":42.590102,"lng":1.213908,"ele":1166.9},{"lat":42.59019,"lng":1.213952,"ele":1168},{"lat":42.590193,"lng":1.213953,"ele":1168.2},{"lat":42.590292,"lng":1.21394,"ele":1170.3},{"lat":42.590315,"lng":1.213943,"ele":1170.7},{"lat":42.590405,"lng":1.213933,"ele":1171.6},{"lat":42.590495,"lng":1.21395,"ele":1172.6},{"lat":42.590582,"lng":1.213995,"ele":1173.6},{"lat":42.59063,"lng":1.21402,"ele":1174.1},{"lat":42.590677,"lng":1.214043,"ele":1176.2},{"lat":42.590655,"lng":1.214067,"ele":1177.7},{"lat":42.590747,"lng":1.214048,"ele":1179.4},{"lat":42.590842,"lng":1.214045,"ele":1180.1},{"lat":42.59094,"lng":1.21403,"ele":1181.2},{"lat":42.591032,"lng":1.213993,"ele":1182.3},{"lat":42.591127,"lng":1.213962,"ele":1183.5},{"lat":42.591227,"lng":1.21394,"ele":1184.4},{"lat":42.591317,"lng":1.213895,"ele":1185.5},{"lat":42.591352,"lng":1.213878,"ele":1186.1},{"lat":42.59135,"lng":1.213857,"ele":1187.2},{"lat":42.591347,"lng":1.213878,"ele":1187.4},{"lat":42.591417,"lng":1.213877,"ele":1187.4},{"lat":42.591435,"lng":1.213753,"ele":1187.3},{"lat":42.591405,"lng":1.21372,"ele":1183.2},{"lat":42.5914,"lng":1.21371,"ele":1182.8},{"lat":42.591398,"lng":1.21371,"ele":1182.8},{"lat":42.591332,"lng":1.213667,"ele":1182.8},{"lat":42.591248,"lng":1.213612,"ele":1182.8},{"lat":42.591252,"lng":1.213595,"ele":1182.9},{