('wikiloc', '28420118', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/santuari-de-cabrera-cim-de-cabrera-28420118', 'Cabrera Sanctuary (100 Peaks FEEC)', '{"en":"Shorter loop to the Sanctuary","ca":"Circular més curta al Santuari","es":"Circular más corta al Santuario"}'::jsonb, 'Santuari de Cabrera (100 Cims FEEC) Hiking trail in el Prat de Sant Julià, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Santuari de Cabrera (Cim de Cabrera)', '{"en":"This moderate 5.8 km loop ascends to the Santuari de Cabrera, located on the summit of Cabrera. The route offers a direct and efficient way to reach this iconic viewpoint.\n\nStarting from a point near the base, the trail gains 417 meters of elevation, providing a good workout for hikers. The path leads to the sanctuary, which sits at over 1300 meters, offering panoramic views of the surrounding regions. The loop nature of the trail ensures a varied return journey.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 5.8 km ascendeix al Santuari de Cabrera, situat al cim de Cabrera. La ruta ofereix una manera directa i eficient d''arribar a aquest punt de vista icònic.\n\nComençant des d''un punt proper a la base, el sender guanya 417 metres de desnivell, proporcionant un bon exercici per als excursionistes. El camí porta al santuari, que es troba a més de 1300 metres, oferint vistes panoràmiques de les regions circumdants. La naturalesa circular del sender assegura un viatge de tornada variat.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 5.8 km asciende al Santuari de Cabrera, situado en la cumbre de Cabrera. La ruta ofrece una manera directa y eficiente de llegar a este punto de vista icónico.\n\nComenzando desde un punto cercano a la base, el sendero gana 417 metros de desnivel, proporcionando un buen ejercicio para los excursionistas. El camino lleva al santuario, que se encuentra a más de 1300 metros, ofreciendo vistas panorámicas de las regiones circundantes. La naturaleza circular del sendero asegura un viaje de regreso variado."}'::jsonb, 'elebben', 5778, 417, 417, 1303, 943, 'moderate', 'loop', 1560, 14880, 942, '2018-09-07', '2018-08', '[{"lat":42.072771,"lng":2.396868,"ele":955},{"lat":42.072724,"lng":2.396859,"ele":954.1},{"lat":42.072676,"lng":2.396842,"ele":953},{"lat":42.07263,"lng":2.396813,"ele":951.8},{"lat":42.072562,"lng":2.396779,"ele":950.3},{"lat":42.072531,"lng":2.396733,"ele":949.3},{"lat":42.072573,"lng":2.396688,"ele":948.9},{"lat":42.072619,"lng":2.396706,"ele":949.6},{"lat":42.072657,"lng":2.396752,"ele":950.9},{"lat":42.072698,"lng":2.396786,"ele":952.1},{"lat":42.072759,"lng":2.396806,"ele":953.3},{"lat":42.07281,"lng":2.396809,"ele":954.1},{"lat":42.072854,"lng":2.396829,"ele":955.3},{"lat":42.072898,"lng":2.396859,"ele":956.7},{"lat":42.072942,"lng":2.396899,"ele":958.3},{"lat":42.073033,"lng":2.396916,"ele":960.1},{"lat":42.073076,"lng":2.39689,"ele":960.1},{"lat":42.073117,"lng":2.396865,"ele":960.2},{"lat":42.073164,"lng":2.396825,"ele":960.1},{"lat":42.073211,"lng":2.396817,"ele":960.7},{"lat":42.073278,"lng":2.396827,"ele":962},{"lat":42.073328,"lng":2.396834,"ele":962.9},{"lat":42.073385,"lng":2.39684,"ele":964.2},{"lat":42.07343,"lng":2.39685,"ele":965.4},{"lat":42.07349,"lng":2.396871,"ele":967.1},{"lat":42.073541,"lng":2.396883,"ele":968.4},{"lat":42.073588,"lng":2.396894,"ele":969.6},{"lat":42.073633,"lng":2.396925,"ele":971.1},{"lat":42.073659,"lng":2.396975,"ele":972.3},{"lat":42.073705,"lng":2.396967,"ele":973.2},{"lat":42.073749,"lng":2.396932,"ele":973.8},{"lat":42.073777,"lng":2.396881,"ele":974},{"lat":42.073785,"lng":2.396812,"ele":973.6},{"lat":42.073789,"lng":2.396749,"ele":973.1},{"lat":42.073821,"lng":2.396695,"ele":973.8},{"lat":42.07386,"lng":2.396656,"ele":974.9},{"lat":42.073901,"lng":2.396628,"ele":976},{"lat":42.073943,"lng":2.396607,"ele":976.9},{"lat":42.073974,"lng":2.396563,"ele":977.3},{"lat":42.074015,"lng":2.396515,"ele":977.8},{"lat":42.07406,"lng":2.39649,"ele":978.6},{"lat":42.074115,"lng":2.396489,"ele":979.9}