('wikiloc', '28672086', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/sorteny-pic-de-la-serrera-2912m-2018-09-15-28672086', 'Sorteny - Pic de la Serrera (2912m) 2018-09-15', '{"en":"Circular from Sorteny parking","ca":"Circular des de l''aparcament de Sorteny","es":"Circular desde el parking de Sorteny"}'::jsonb, 'Sorteny - Pic de la Serrera (2912m) 2018-09-15 Hiking trail in Les Sobiranes, Ordino (Andorra). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Pic de la Serrera, 2912m, is one of the six highest peaks in Andorra. 
 
It''s good observatory on all the Andorran peaks and two on French side. The peak can be reached without any special equipment from valleys Ransol and Sorteny. 
 
This route is starting from Sorteny parking and is ascending along Riu de les Cebes, then is descending from the peak through another valley along Riu de la Cebollera. 
 
Descent from the peak goes through the fastest route, but it''s steep. If you prefer more comfortable way, you can return from the peak the same path as you ascended it, but you will miss beautiful river with cascades and forest on the way back. 
 
 
Panoramic photos of the journey: 
 
